    obligation to retain such data to comply with local laws and regulations, if any.
    <strong><u>Please do not send us copies of passports or identification documents. Also, please refrain from
            sending us unnecessary personal data through any of our features</u></strong>.
</p>
<p>
    To process certain emails, we use the customer service and ticketing system of Zendesk Inc. To this end,
