    <li>
        Right to be forgotten: you can file a request to delete any personal data we process about you;
    </li>
    <li>
        Right to data portability: if technically feasible, you have the right to ask us to transfer your
        processed personal data to a third party;
    </li>
    <li>
        Right to restriction: you can file a request with us to (temporarily) restrict the processing of your
        personal data;
